msgid ""
"Historical 184-file dirty development overlay comparisons remain "
"separately identified in their original reports. Final clean P versus "
"7b985: all 11 strict comparisons passed from actual A/B build artifacts "
"with independent ELF/map/IRQ review; no rebuild for path normalization. "
"I2C total loaded Flash delta G474/H743/U575 = -4/+40/+64 B, composed of "
"code/alignment +108/+152/+224 B, readonly config +24 B each, "
"path-pool/alignment -136/-136/-184 B; reserved RAM -24/-16/-24 B and "
"state 28 to 8 B. Eight UART totals range +168 to +392 B Flash, with "
"code/alignment +336 to +384 B, readonly config 60 B and negative "
"source-path/alignment contributions; all reserve 48 B less RAM, TX state"
" 96 to 48 B and duplex 144 to 96 B. Source-root string reductions are "
"not architecture savings. UART selected IRQ code at most +2 B/one static"
" instruction, up to two config loads; duplex channel local push frame "
"grows 16 to 24 B while MSP reservation is unchanged. No new selected IRQ"
" indirect call; cycles/WCET/dynamic stack high-water are not measured. "
"Portable cost evidence archive SHA256 "
"fb0f63bcae83f7a5b278a311f67107bf4f8c99fcee0014638b0fb26c0936567f, "
"4035953 B / 1184 files; original source/tool/SDK inputs remain explicit "
"external dependencies."
msgstr ""
"184 文件脏开发覆盖层的历史比较在原报告中单独标识。最终干净 P 对比 7b985：11 组严格比较均基于实际 A/B 构建产物通过，并经独立"
" ELF/map/IRQ 审查；未为了路径规范化重建。I2C 加载 Flash 总变化 G474/H743/U575 = -4/+40/+64 "
"B，组成为代码／对齐 +108/+152/+224 B、每项只读配置 +24 B、路径池／对齐 -136/-136/-184 B；预留 RAM "
"-24/-16/-24 B，状态 28→8 B。八组 UART 的 Flash 总变化为 +168 至 +392 B，含代码／对齐 +336 至"
" +384 B、只读配置 60 B，以及负的源码路径／对齐贡献；预留 RAM 均减少 48 B，TX 状态 96→48 B、双向状态 "
"144→96 B。源码根路径字符串缩短不是架构节省。UART 选定 IRQ 代码最多增加 2 B／一条静态指令、最多两次配置读取；双向 "
"channel 的局部 push 栈帧从 16 增至 24 B，MSP 预留不变。选定 IRQ "
"没有新增间接调用；cycles/WCET／动态栈高水位未测量。可搬移成本证据归档 SHA256 为 "
